      "mergedPostDetails": "# Issue:\n\nThe Emoji Category button in the Main Menu Gallery Tab does not correctly minimize when minimizing the navigation panel. It stays the same size as if nothing changed.\n\n**Repro Steps:**\n\n1. Open Main Menu  \n\n2. Go to Gallery Tab  \n\n3. Click on the top arrow to minimize the navigation panel\n\nIf you do this you will notice that the Emojis Category button does not minimize at all.\n\n# Expected Behavior:  \n\nThe Emojis Category button should minimize normally, just like User Icons or Photos do.\n\n# Attachments:  \n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/hhicrf.mp4",
